  description="Tesla Supercharger rates jumped in late 2026. Compare exact member ($0.40–$0.43/kWh), non-member ($0.57–$0.60/kWh), peak vs off-peak, and $12.99 membership break-even math."
  category="US EV Economics"
  updatedDate="Updated Nov 2026"
  publishedTime="2026-11-18T08:00:00Z"
  modifiedTime="2026-11-18T08:00:00Z"
  author="John"
  currentSlug="tesla-supercharger-cost-per-kwh-2026-member-vs-non-member"
