      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
        <span><strong>Tesla Owners &amp; Members Rate:</strong> Average <strong>$0.40 to $0.43 per kWh</strong> nationally (overnight off-peak dips to <strong>$0.30–$0.36/kWh</strong>). All Tesla vehicles receive this tier automatically.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
        <span><strong>Non-Tesla Pay-As-You-Go (PAYG):</strong> Averages <strong>$0.57 to $0.60 per kWh</strong>, with peak-hour urban hubs in California and the Northeast reaching <strong>$0.65 to $0.72+/kWh</strong>.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
        <span><strong>The $12.99/Month Membership Break-Even:</strong> Saving an average of <strong>$0.17/kWh</strong> means the subscription pays for itself after consuming just <strong>76.4 kWh/month</strong>—roughly <strong>1.2 to 1.5 fast-charge stops</strong>. Non-Tesla drivers embarking on a single road trip break even in one weekend!</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
