      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed">
        The official US Energy Information Administration (EIA) national residential electricity average. Overnight off-peak EV utility plans in states like Texas and Florida drop as low as <strong>$0.08 to $0.12/kWh</strong>.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">
        <div>Level 2 Real-World Cost: <span class="text-emerald-700 font-black">5.2¢ / mile</span></div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-0.5">68% cheaper than member Supercharging; 70% cheaper than non-member.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4 -->
    <div class="p-5 bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-red-100 text-red-900">Penalties &amp; Fees</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">Idle &amp; Congestion</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-950 mb-1">$0.50 – $1.00 / Minute</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed">
        Tesla charges <strong>$0.50/min</strong> when a station is 50% full, jumping to <strong>$1.00/min</strong> if 100% full. Disconnect within 5 minutes to waive the fee. Additionally, a <strong>$1.00/min congestion fee</strong> applies above 80% SoC at busy sites.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">
        <div>Dwell Guard: <span class="text-red-700 font-black">Unplug promptly at 80%</span></div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Prevents costly $30+ accidental overstay penalties.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 2: Comparison Table -->
  <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-gray-950 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">
    2. 50 kWh &amp; 75 kWh Charge Session Cost Comparison: Fast Charging vs. Home &amp; Gas
  </h2>
  <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
