    <li><strong>75 kWh Session:</strong> A deep 10% to 85% recharge on a long-range crossover, full-size SUV, or electric pickup like the Tesla Model Y Long Range, Ford Mustang Mach-E Extended Range, or Rivian R1T (adding roughly 260 to 285 miles of highway range).</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Responsive Comparison Table -->
  <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm not-prose">
    <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-800">
      <thead class="bg-gray-950 text-white uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">
        <tr>
          <th class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">Charging Method / Energy Source</th>
          <th class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-center">Effective Rate</th>
          <th class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-right">50 kWh Top-Up (~180 mi)</th>
          <th class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-right">75 kWh Top-Up (~270 mi)</th>
          <th class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 text-right">Cost Per Mile (3.5 mi/kWh)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 font-medium">
        <!-- Home Off-Peak -->
        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
          <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
            <strong class="text-gray-950 block">🌙 Home Off-Peak Time-of-Use (TOU)</strong>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Overnight utility rate + 10% Level 2 AC loss</span>
          </td>
          <td class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-center font-bold text-emerald-700">$0.080 / kWh</td>
          <td class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-right font-black text-emerald-700">$4.40</td>
          <td class="py-4 px-3 sm:px-4 text-right font-black text-emerald-700">$6.60</td>
          <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 text-right font-bold text-emerald-700">2.51¢ / mi</td>
